OL,3,AMinister condemns disorder at
OL,4,APortsmouth anti-migrant protest after
OL,5,Apolice officers hurt
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice are seeking to identify
OL,8,Fprotesters after several officers were
OL,9,Finjured and vehicles damaged in
OL,10,FPortsmouth at a demonstration sparked
OL,11,Fby the arrival of 120 migrants in a
OL,12,Fsingle dinghy.
OL,14,FPolicing Minister Sarah Jones told the
OL,15,FHouse of Commons the disorder on Sunday
OL,16,Fnight was "intimidating and thuggish"
OL,17,Fand warned "those who cross into
OL,18,Fillegality" would "face the full force
OL,19,Fof the law".
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
