OL,3,APalestinian parents fear for children's
OL,4,Alives at school as settler attacks grow
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix people, including three pupils at
OL,7,Fthe school, have been killed in
OL,8,Fal-Mughayyir this year, in a surge of
OL,9,Fsettler-related violence against
OL,10,FPalestinians. One of them, 14-year-old
OL,11,FAws al-Naasan, was shot dead by a
OL,12,Fsettler outside the school gates in
OL,13,FApril.
OL,15,F"I was inside my classroom and two
OL,16,Flittle students came rushing to tell me
OL,17,Fthere were settlers close to the school
OL,18,Fwall," remembers English teacher Waheed
OL,19,FAbu Naem, whose brother Jihad was also
OL,20,Fkilled by an Israeli soldier in the
OL,21,Fsame attack.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
