OL,3,AEiffel Tower shut by staff protest
OL,4,Aafter female workers moved for
OL,5,Areligious visit
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Eiffel Tower was closed on Monday
OL,8,Fafter staff went on strike over female
OL,9,Fworkers being removed for the visit of
OL,10,Fa Hindu religious group, workers and
OL,11,Fmanagement said.
OL,13,FA delegation of around 100 people
OL,14,Flinked to the Bochasanwasi Akshar
OL,15,FPurushottam Swaminarayan Sanstha (BAPS)
OL,16,Fgroup visited the landmark in the
OL,17,FFrench capital on Saturday.
OL,19,FStaff union representative Diane
OL,20,FDavoine says as they arrived at the
OL,21,Fmonument, women were told to move.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
